      "rationale": "The design is sound, proportionate and executable: six options scored against criteria fixed in advance with the nearest loser separated on a named mechanism, twelve of twenty-two capabilities met by reuse, and every one of fourteen risks carrying a trigger, an owner and a verification checkpoint ahead of the irreversible step it bears on. Approved most of all because it declined the two shortcuts available to it: it refused to reword AC-008 to match the reachable backend, and it corrected the rollback that the change record alone would have left incomplete. A-005 accepted as record corrections, every divergence running toward more delivered than recorded; the capture residual accepted as a recorded gap, not a met criterion",
